MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 52e4a196ade8fa64b94cade3bdeb555c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Popup_Level03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoPopupData
  popupId: level03_intro
  pages:
  - title: Level 3 - Brick tiles
    body: 'Some rooms now need <b>brick</b> floors. Brick tiles are made in a new
      station: the <b>Mixer</b>.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Using the Mixer
    body: 'The Mixer has <b>two</b> interaction points:


      <b>The drum</b> -
      carry a material to it and press <b>E</b> to put it inside.

      <b>The handle</b>
      - press <b>E</b> to mix what''s inside.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Mixer formula
    body: '<b>Brick tile = Brick + Brick + Cement</b>


      The order doesn''t
      matter. Grab Brick and Cement from their piles, fill the drum, then turn the
      handle. A wrong mix won''t work.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Keep it powered
    body: Like every station, the Mixer has its own generator. If it runs out of
      power, refuel it with Oil from the shop.
    image: {fileID: 0}
